# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上 checkout 出 CRLF 造成跨平台 diff 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不要做任何换行转换
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把这几个当文档而不是代码
*.md linguist-documentation
data/*.json linguist-generated
assets/audio/manifest.json linguist-generated
assets/images/manifest.json linguist-generated
assets/images/luminance.json linguist-generated
